{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "69ef6587232e4006a816222153aca56a5671942c85c11b5342e85caeab50ee80", "ja": "そして、戦いへ！", "zh": "然后，奔向战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a079f359862261d3fe35e0672e5920f22149c874a1f7be33281f1b58e333cba4", "ja": "開催宣言公演が無事に終わり、打ち上げの\n希望を話し合うメンバー。それぞれ行きたい\n場所が違うためなかなか決まらなかったが、\n最終的に全員の希望が叶いそうなアミューズ\nメントパークに決まったのだった。", "zh": "举办宣言公演顺利结束后，成员们开始商量庆功宴想去哪里。由于每个人想去的地方都不一样，一直没能决定下来，但最后还是定在了一个似乎能满足所有人愿望的游乐园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "598af22f27f239ceabcb53a24e7022e4169b643b9875c332f6dfedeed4ffcba5", "ja": "（開催宣言公演が終わった。\nせっかくなので、打ち上げをしたいんだけど……）", "zh": "（开场宣言公演顺利结束了。难得有这个机会，我想办个庆功宴，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "5e682592413de44bb013f4cdc07bc919e9b0448cbeea0b292510ce6cb5eacb83", "ja": "ぜったい、公園！　たまき、公園がいい！", "zh": "绝对要去公园！环想去公园！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "64af9eb4a007f8c136dc03f15cac619c6e372c087370455704da591f5fec9c0b", "ja": "環、公園はいつでも行けるでしょ？\nボクはショッピングモールがいいなぁ。", "zh": "环，公园随时都能去吧？\n我想去购物中心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "9a68b4da28b993d67b099a02fc4c46261e67974ba00169c09b01912fba3796e4", "ja": "エミリーたち、{$P$}と映画\n観に行ったんでしょ？　いいなーっ、ボクも行きたい！", "zh": "艾米莉她们是和{$P$}一起去看电影了吧？真好啊——我也想去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "0f8f98b3df580852154cad64e202acd63ee1aea660c58e7fd8cbc84605a64ab3", "ja": "あの……美味しいと評判で、気になっている\n和菓子のお店があるのですが、そちらなどは……？", "zh": "那个……我听说有一家日式点心店口碑很好，\n一直很在意，去那里之类的是否合适呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f05f7f93d88e7155e7056d631fe414abbb3569d02dc9ed44815fab5b54e4fc1", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、みんなで登山とかどうかな？\nドライブでもいいよ♪", "zh": "那那，大家一起去爬山怎么样？\n开车兜风也可以哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "e0bef94b21c18d9ee53467dd82e22fe2af2fbc5af981b85428dcbc3c5aacc938", "ja": "うふふ、見事にバラバラですね～。\nどうしましょうか～？", "zh": "呵呵，大家的意见还真是五花八门呢～。\n该怎么办才好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "d196f5045fb0d319c1b533b6e0dcac02fe2b1c98424014636f667c9c1d5c2ab8", "ja": "はい……なので代表として、私が意見をまとめることに\nなったんですけど……うぅ、まとまる気がしない……。", "zh": "是的……所以作为代表，我得负责汇总大家的意见……可是……呜呜，感觉根本汇总不起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3383a0f68f402a503faceb41939f33984fd3c0547552cf2d707d48178faec1ef", "ja": "……もう少しかかりそうか？", "zh": "……看起来还要花点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "1dc1c6f11bd068462a190ba61866fc0405cfe81be18fa2d133ddb1422d834abf", "ja": "{$P$}！　自分は関係ないような\n顔していないで、なんとかしてください！", "zh": "{$P$}！　别一副跟自己\n毫无关系的样子，快想想办法啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d617cc40153bfde9ac7922a9dd8fb2b764172ee653c69fbd06c4764cdf84b87", "ja": "ええっ！？　うーん、そうだな……\n静香と朋花は？　どこに行きたいとかないのか？", "zh": "诶！？　嗯——这个嘛……\n静香和朋花呢？没有什么想去的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "c62511090493553e5085d7c792218d369060296939aa95ad215ac959b4b7a430", "ja": "私ですか？　ええと……　\nまあ、気になってるうどん屋はありますけど。", "zh": "我吗？呃……\n虽然有一家我挺在意的乌冬面店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "28278c4cd51303b3a7a6ff5add45f87b2a837e6006c705f45a7629b411e74313", "ja": "私は、どこでもいいですよ～？\n{$P$}さんのセンスに任せます～♪", "zh": "我去哪儿都可以哦～？就交给{$P$}先生来决定吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "17e97b3f056a43a446cc0ecb6e0f9d3e1e7ef8480aaa496c5bf2f9a4cc365321", "ja": "朋花のが、一番困るやつだな……うーん。\nじゃあ、アミューズメントパークとかはどうだ？", "zh": "朋花说的，才是最让人头疼的……唔——。\n那，去游乐园之类的地方怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "07495597097728258c73d3088558df80b9df4256499303141fc352ab84dae677", "ja": "アミューズメントパーク？", "zh": "游乐园？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fbf849dccd5cee8b12db4fbe0bd164e309ca3cca987527a84e260c0ab5410c17", "ja": "うん。併設された施設でショッピングもできるし、\nアトラクションで色々と遊べるしな。", "zh": "嗯。那里还有配套设施，可以购物，也能在游乐项目上尽情玩一玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "30eff41f4ed2fa13561b333945b37c2e79014dc0e10786f5aa87a2396ea6a3ca", "ja": "フードコートに、和菓子店やうどん屋さんもあるし。\nみんなの希望を叶えられると思うけど……どうかな？", "zh": "美食广场里还有和果子店和乌冬面馆。应该能满足大家的愿望……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "2387366b89d8a1ca29c421976a281f05e0540ee97cc852bf67d29896a659bc56", "ja": "わーい、みんなで遊園地に行けるの！？\nたまき、大賛成だぞ～♪", "zh": "哇——大家可以一起去游乐园！？  \n环，大力赞成哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "d6033a9303fc182c5548c1db680e123b850cda3e4bc749c94a4cd3529e5c2fdc", "ja": "Wow！　和菓子のお店もあるのですか？\nとっても楽しそうです♪", "zh": "哇！　还有日式点心店吗？\n感觉会非常开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "0d4881f0af24db5786f784f9ff8f373b04e02504bf03e7ce6f3b18b6cf750842", "ja": "それならボクも大賛成ですよ！　でも、いいんですか？\n{$P$}のお財布が……。", "zh": "那我也非常赞成！不过，真的没问题吗？\n{$P$}的钱包……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c359afc4b0023e907de9b1cf87b7ee4a1ef1bfdae026125b6f115c34fd15763c", "ja": "まあ……打ち上げだし、大丈夫だよ！\nうん。多分、大丈夫……。", "zh": "哎呀……毕竟是庆功宴，没问题的！\n嗯。大概没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "19de88794635cf88b70b77c3603ca5907066ac78c702bb34cb8df1241acc3ea8", "ja": "あ、でも麗花の登山とドライブは叶わないな……。\n観覧車でいい景色が見られるけど、それでどうだ？", "zh": "啊，不过丽花的登山和兜风是没法实现了……\n虽然坐摩天轮能看到不错的景色，但这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "df1ac0ad0873d395591493d202ea2c2c8470ba8d2253912680ac5cf9e8580492", "ja": "いいですよ！　それにこう見えて、\n遊園地は大好きなんです。わーいわーい♪", "zh": "好啊！而且别看我这样，\n我其实超喜欢游乐园的。好耶～好耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "1b465f8e6c7a935fd49188ba50e45d8665369955f5154b0c4cbae580792ed8b7", "ja": "なかなかいい提案でしたね～。みんなの\n意見をまとめるとは、褒めてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "真是个不错的提议呢～能把大家的意见汇总起来，值得表扬哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "dfeb70accbd3fbd0d57695d7dc531ce094737387facc6611eafda76577df2410", "ja": "でも、これくらいはできてもらわないと困りますよ～？\n打ち上げも公演も、本番はこれからですからね～。", "zh": "不过，这种程度还是得做到才行哦～？\n庆功宴和公演，正式演出现在才要开始呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3928e722bb7fb00d7f36728b8b05784dc72bb2909f4b69add30917b6a8143d54", "ja": "うん、そうだな……。", "zh": "嗯，确实呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "93ed6235fd50e686968ebaa85bd5ffc27a1feefe0cc49797330de79c03dd78f9", "ja": "次の『BATTLE OF THEATER』から、\n本格的な戦いが始まるんですよね……。", "zh": "从下一场《BATTLE OF THEATER》开始，就要正式展开战斗了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "26d191cc34a3826457cf43daa712ee220c1273e745bebcae13ec059aa7cd8b13", "ja": "どんな公演になるんだろう？　ちょっと怖い気も\nするけど……でも、楽しみでもあるよね！", "zh": "会是怎样的演出呢？感觉好像有点可怕……不过，也让人很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "cdc3ce3b0309202c500cc0c56d037c8f6bb9d0a82b18fb14d2c71560f835e024", "ja": "目が離せなくなりそう……{$P$}、\nみんなのこと、よろしくお願いしますね？", "zh": "感觉会让人移不开视线……{$P$}，大家就拜托你了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e53c17030fd059fa9e923fe5056e7548cb5ad8c03242f33bb7f871d7ea3fe66d", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　みんなが安心して、全力で\nぶつかり合えるように、フォローするつもりだよ。", "zh": "啊，当然！为了让大家能够安心地全力一战，我会尽力支持大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7f317fc5065d90a74ba95c0127c213639d91db83db81ff52c915793e6802d7e5", "ja": "（この先どんな戦いが待っているのか、わからない\nけど……みんなと一緒に、全力で挑むだけだ！）", "zh": "（不知道前方会有什么样的战斗在等着我们……不过，只要和大家一起全力以赴就行了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
